  "diary": "The day began with the practical, as days in Delhi must. Ramesh informed me that the Directorate rests on Sunday, a fact that closed the door on my immediate hopes of administrative correction. I walked in Lodhi Gardens, buying chai from a stall at the gate, where the steam seemed to argue as loudly as the file on my desk. The heat is a physical weight, but the file’s contradiction is heavier. The register lists me as a dead professor turned Joint Secretary. In the morning, I thought this was a slip of the sign, an error to be excused. By evening, after reviewing the vouchers and Ramesh’s conflicting notes on the dhobi’s bill, I saw it differently. The state’s sign-system does not repair itself through the officer’s good faith. The discrepancy between my ledger and Ramesh’s note regarding Salim the washerman is not a matter of memory; it is a structural gap. The state’s money cannot be settled by either man’s word. It must be traced to the person who made the entry. The misdescription is not a private mistake; it is a contradiction in the Notion itself. The register knows me only as what it has written. To correct it, I must first understand how the error became an institutional fact. The owl spreads its wings in the dusk, but the contradiction remains on the desk, waiting for Monday. I am hungry, and the body asks for sleep. The idea must rest.",
